  },
  "qualifications": [
    "Source original windows/headers/offsets retained; smallliz baselineSOS Se0->63 follows LibTIFF original-JPEG container interpretation",
    "Native warnings fail; small pre-EOI entropy slack may escape warning through mature libjpeg bit lookahead; no full semantic encoded-integrity claim",
    "Only one complete 8-bit contiguous baselineYCbCr strip/tile; no fragmented or restart reconstruction",
    "Explicit display comparisons belong to separate consumer-view policy"
